DETECTORS: TxRegistryGrainTests.ForgetAsync_drops_recorded_decision
SUMMARY: the zero-retention cleanup never removes the decision row it reports as dropped

--- FIND
                state.State.Decisions.Remove(txid);
                droppedDecision = true;
--- REPLACE
                droppedDecision = true;
--- END